### Investigation & Research

#### OTA update adoption by update ID in PostHog
- **Repo:** `audit-lite` (via `posthog`)
- **Question:** Can PostHog show what percentage of active users are on a given update ID? Specifically for `01a0cdab-a56a-7946-84ae-7a02373b52d5` (Android) and `01a0cdab-a56a-765d-8570-f0bb133c5c52` (iOS), which are the same release with different update IDs per platform.
- **Outcome:** Built a query for the share of active users on each target update ID and re-ran it to track adoption. It started as a continuously running script and was then changed to an on-demand command that can be run from anywhere. The command was extended to give a percentage breakdown of users across all versions.
